values ('e3f4a5b6-7c8d-4f32-9b12-2c3d4e5f6a22', 'advanced-composition-rhetoric', 'Advanced Composition / Rhetoric', 'Writing is treated as purposeful action shaped by audience, context, and kairos, using classical appeals, Toulmin argument, research in a scholarly conversation, and ethical use of evidence. Students study genre and discourse communities, sentence style, long-form architecture, revision, and publication standards, then rhetorical criticism, multimodal and digital writing, civic persuasion, transfer, and a capstone portfolio.');

